<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n104578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρᾰσιά</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρσός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hurdle, crate,</i> whereon to dry figs, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				451
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				3.10
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρσιή</span></b>  (
				Ion.
			) in <i><span class="en">
				Semon.
				39
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τερσιά.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>the dried figs</i> themselves, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.144
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>drying-place,</i> for corn, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				118
			</span></i>; also for cheese, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; or for bricks, <i>kiln,</i> Greg.Cor.<i><span class="en">
				p.514
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i></div>
